ije nego što sjećanja koja ih vežu zauvijek nestanu.</p>\n        </div>\n        \n\n      <section class=\"single-event__faqs\">\n        \n      </section>\n        \n      </div>\n<div class=\"single-event__single-ticket-container\">\n              \n              <div class=\"single-event__calendar-icon\"></div>\n              <div class=\"single-event__ticket-info-container\">\n                \n                \n                \n                <div>\n                  <strong>03.10.2026. • sub<span class=\"date-separator\"> •</span></strong>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"event-end-date\">17:00 sati</div>\n                \n              </div>\n              \n              \n              <a class=\"button-primary-large single-event__buy-ticket-button\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://app.core-event.co/events/zaboravljeni-otok-forgotten-island-sink-65a9/register?lang=hr\">\n                \n                  \n                    KUPI ULAZNICU\n                  \n                \n              </a>\n              \n            </div>\n<div class=\"single-event__single-ticket-container\">\n              \n              <div class=\"single-event__calendar-icon\"></div>\n              <div class=\"single-event__ticket-info-container\">\n                \n                \n                \n                <div>\n                  <strong>04.10.2026. • ned<span class=\"date-separator\"> •</span></strong>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"event-end-date\">11:00 sati</div>\n                \n              </div>\n              \n              \n              <a class=\"button-primary-large single-event__buy-ticket-button\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://app.core-event.co/events/zaboravljeni-otok-forgotten-island-sink-68ba/register?lang=hr\">\n                \n                  \n                    KUPI ULAZNICU\n                  \n                \n              </a>\n              \n            </div>\n<div c